<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - VLSI started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - VLSI started as hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it started coverage of VLSI Technology Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Estimates 1996 earnings at $0.26 per share, 1997 at $0.74 per share.</p>
<p>-- Cited recent financial struggle at VLSI, partly due to semiconductor industry correction and partly due to transition in company's product mix.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/8 to 13-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
